7,"attacks":2,"strength":3,"dmgHit":3,"dmgCrit":6}]}],"abilities":[{"id":"76da2eab","name":"Executioner's Strike","cost":"quad","text":"This fighter makes a bonus attack action.  In addition, add 1 to the Attacks and Strength characteristics of that attack action.","runemarks":["hero"],"subfaction":"Kainan's Reapers"},{"id":"8fdbd27a","name":"Endless Duty","cost":"double","text":"A fighter can only use this ability if an enemy fighter has been taken down by an attack action made by them this activation. This fighter makes a bonus move action or a bonus attack action.","runemarks":["hero","champion"]},{"id":"da3f058b","name":"Form Shieldwall","cost":"double","text":"Until the end of the battle round, add 1 to the Toughness characteristic of friendly fighters with the Ossiarch Bonereapers faction runemark and the Bulwark runemark while they are within 3\" of this fighter.","runemarks":["bulwark"]},{"id":"945dc908","name":"Hunt and Kill","cost":"double","text":"A fighter can only use this ability if there is a visible enemy fighter within 6\" of them. This fighter makes a bonus move action and must finish closer to the closest visible enemy fighter than they were at the start of that move action.","runemarks":["destroyer"]},{"id":"adad4b92","name":"Nadirite Weapon","cost":"double","text":"Until the end of this fighter's activation, add 1 to the damage points allocated to enemy fighters by each hit and critical hit from melee attack actions made by this fighter.","runemarks":[]},{"id":"96120f68","name":"Deathrider Charge","cost":"triple","text":"Until the end of this fighter's activation, the next time this fighter finishes a move action within 1\" of an enemy fighter, pick a visible enemy fighter within 1\" of this fighter. Allocate a number of damage points to that fighter equal to the value of this ability.","runemarks":["warrior"]},{"id":"96c6da56","name":"Soul-guide","cost":"triple","text":"Until the end of the battle round, add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of melee attack actions made by visible friendly fighters while they are within 6\" of this fighter.","runemarks":["hero","mystic"]},{"id":"6d4a1974","name":"The Boneshaper's Art","cost":"triple","text":"Remove up to D3 damage points allocated to each friendly fighter within 6\" of this fighter (roll for each).","runemarks":["hero","trapper"]},{"id":"f74dc829","name":"Unbridled Ferocity","cost":"triple","text":"This fighter makes a bonus move action.","runemarks":["berserker"]},{"id":"43124d95","name":"Unstoppable Advance","cost":"triple","text":"Until the end of the battle round, add half the value of this ability (rounding up) to the Move characteristic of friendly fighters that are in the same battle group as this fighter.","runemarks":["hero"]},{"id":"21166137","name":"Blade-strike Aspect","cost":"quad","text":"Until the end of this fighter's activation, add 3 to the Attacks characteristic of attack actions made by this fighter.","runemarks":["destroyer"]},{"id":"3026ca6f","name":"Soulreaper Scythe","cost":"quad","text":"Allocate a number of damage points equal to the value of this ability to all visible enemy fighters within 3\" of this fighter.","runemarks":["hero","terrifying"]},{"id":"cb23e335","name":"Deathly Prowess","cost":"reaction","text":"A fighter can make this reaction after they are targeted by a melee attack action but before the hit rolls are made.  If each hit roll from that attack action results in a miss, allocate 5 damage points to the attacking fighter.","runemarks":[]},{"id":"c6ad14aa","name":"Refined Creations","cost":"double","text":"Pick a visible friendly fighter with the Ossiarch Bonereapers faction runemark and the Fly runemark within 3\" of this fighter. Until the end of the battle round, add half the value of this ability (rounding up) to the Attacks characteristic of the next melee attack action made by that fighter.","runemarks":["elite"]},{"id":"2eddaae2","name":"Ranks Unbroken By Dissent","cost":"battletrait","text":"If a friendly fighter with this battle trait uses an ability that requires the Ossirach Bonereapers runemark and has a range, add 1\" to the range of the ability.","runemarks":[]}]}
